cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or software, please cite it as below. Credit individual images with their credit lines (credit_line column, credits.csv or image_references.bib)."
title: "Digital heritage in video games: Historical structures in video games and their real-world counterparts"
abstract: "A catalogue of real places (buildings, monuments, districts, settlements and natural formations) shown in video games, linking each game's version of a place to the real place, with in-game images, photographs of the real places, dates, eras, descriptions and the source and license of every item. Distributed with the Python package gameheritage."
type: dataset
authors:
